---
layout: base.njk
title: ""
description: "HD2Lab의 개발 기록. Devlog, Architecture, Troubleshooting, Notes — 만들고 부수고 다시 세운 이야기."
---
{% import "parts/post-list.njk" as parts %}
{% set posts = collections.diaryPosts %}
{% set categories = collections.diaryCategories %}
{% set recent = posts.slice(0, 5) %}
{% set latest = posts[0] or null %}

<section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="diary-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>HD2Lab / Diary</p>
        <h1 id="diary-title">Build it. Break it.<br><span>Write it down.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">만든 것과 부순 것, 그리고 다시 세운 이유.<br>HD2Lab의 작업 기록을 여기에 남긴다.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ '/write/' | url }}">새 글 쓰기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="button button-ghost" href="#categories">카테고리 보기</a>
        </div>
        <dl class="hero-stats">
            <div><dt>Posts</dt><dd>{{ posts | length }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Categories</dt><dd>{{ categories | length }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Last update</dt><dd>{% if latest %}{{ latest.date | displayDate }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</dd></div>
        </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="hero-terminal">
            <span class="terminal-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            <pre><code><span class="t-dim">$</span> ls diary/
<span class="t-accent">devlog</span>  <span class="t-accent">architecture</span>
<span class="t-accent">troubleshooting</span>  <span class="t-accent">notes</span>

<span class="t-dim">$</span> cat latest.md
<span class="t-text">{% if latest %}{{ latest.data.title }}{% else %}아직 기록이 없다.{% endif %}</span>
<span class="t-dim">$</span> <span class="t-cursor">▌</span></code></pre>
        </div>
        <p>Record <span>+</span> Review <span>+</span> Repeat</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="categories shell" id="categories" aria-labelledby="categories-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Categories</p>
            <h2 id="categories-title">네 개의 서랍.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>글은 주제별로 쌓인다. 서랍을 열면 전체 목록이 나온다.</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="category-grid" aria-label="Diary categories">
        {% for category in categories %}
        <a class="category-card" href="{{ ('/categories/' + category.slug + '/') | url }}">
            <span class="card-index">{{ category.index }} / {{ category.name | upper }}</span>
            <span class="category-name">{{ category.name }}</span>
            <span class="category-blurb">{{ category.blurb or '이 주제로 쓴 글 모음.' }}</span>
            <span class="category-foot">
                <span class="category-count">{{ category.count }} post{% if category.count != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="category-latest">{% if category.latest %}최근 {{ category.latest | relativeDate }}{% else %}아직 글 없음{% endif %}</span>
            </span>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
    </nav>
</section>

<section class="recent shell" id="recent" aria-labelledby="recent-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Recent</p>
            <h2 id="recent-title">최근 기록.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>{% if posts | length %}지금까지 {{ posts | length }}편{% else %}첫 글을 기다리는 중{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    {% if posts | length %}
        {{ parts.postList(recent) }}
    {% else %}
        {{ parts.emptyState('아직 쓴 글이 없다. 첫 기록을 남겨 보자.', '/write/') }}
    {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="cta-band shell">
    <div>
        <h2>다음 기록은<br><span>지금 쓰면 된다.</span></h2>
        <p>브라우저에서 쓰고, .md로 내려받거나 GitHub에 바로 커밋한다.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ '/write/' | url }}">새 글 쓰기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</section>
